<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτήδ-ευσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>devotion</i> or <i>attention to</i> a pursuit or
			business, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				369b
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>cultivation of a habit</i> or <i>character,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.86
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					853b
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιότου ἀτρεκεῖς ἐ.</span>
			scrupulous <i>refinements,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				261
			</span></i> (anap.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐξ-εύσεως,</span>
			of a <i>studied</i> style, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				8
			</span></i> ; of baths, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἐ.,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοφυῆ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.2.1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἐπιτήδευσιν</span>
			<i>as a special study,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ
				περίπτωσιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.289
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίς τινος ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.59
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				60.5
			</span></i>.</div>
